Z||000017||Oreif||02-19-2000||10:24 PM||||When I bought my car (used) it was kind of dull. I used the Meguire's 3-step and now I just use the Meguire's Carnuba. As for the Mirrors I used the 3-step process on them twice and now everyone thinks I had my mirrors painted! If you use the cleaner, lots of polish and then wax your mirrors will shine like the rest of the car! With the exception of the front fascia and the Indy scoop all paint on my car is original!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image04.jpg"> ||||reg||1
